<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended narrowly mixed in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 10.83 points to 7225.32, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.66 to 430.77.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.06.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1265 to 1260.</p>
<p>Volume was 601,295,300 compared with 549,400,210 on Monday.</p>
